  "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of ${a}_{13}$,  we remove the $1$st row and the $3$rd column:\n\n$$\nA=|\\begin{aligned}\u2217 & \u2217 & 1 & \u2217 & \u2217 \\\\ 0 & 2 & \u2217 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & \u2217 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & \u2217 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & \u2217 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{13}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${a}_{13}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{13} & =(-1)^{1+3}{M}_{13} \\\\  & ={M}_{13} \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 2 & 1 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 & 6 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 4 & -3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
